  "Setting1": "Value1",
  "Setting2": "Value2"
}
```
Please note that this is a simplified example for demonstrating how to load configuration settings from local JSON file or remote JSON endpoint. Each of the challenges you mentioned (configuration loading and validation, real-time updates, performance optimization, error handling/logging, concurrency control, system integration) will require a more complex solution and it's beyond the scope of this response.
